cleaned_data = remove_outliers(data, threshold=3)
sns.scatterplot(x=cleaned_data, y=cleaned_data)
plt.show()
```

Executing the code above will produce a scatter plot of the cleaned dataset, allowing us to observe the data points without the influence of outliers. This visualization is crucial for understanding the underlying structure of the data.

